====== ALPHA ASL-26555 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

ADSL wifi router manufactured by [[http://www.alphanetworks.com/|ALPHA Networks]], distributed by ISPs like [[wp>Movistar|Movistar]]

Supported since [[https://dev.openwrt.org/changeset/36433/|r36433]]

